{"at": "2026-09-18T06:23:46.372749+00:00", "pr": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pulls/595", "id": 4565964253, "node_id": "PR_kwDOUJyJf88AAAABECcV3Q", "html_url": "https://github.com/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pull/595", "diff_url": "https://github.com/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pull/595.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pull/595.patch", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/issues/595", "number": 595, "state": "open", "locked": false, "title": "feat(local): route approved merge trains through the daemon", "user": {"login": "Dengnifer", "id": 89234078, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjg5MjM0MDc4", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89234078?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer", "html_url": "https://github.com/Dengnifer", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "### Motivation\n- Address #593. The reviewed merge-train tool has no caller in the running daemon, so independently approved stale PRs remain idle with model lanes disabled.\n\n### Description\n- Add a daemon adapter that matches a requested batch's pinned heads against the existing approved-candidate scan, checks claim availability, and prepares a clean primary checkout while preserving telemetry-only local commits.\n- Invoke the existing train synchronously, retaining its combined CI, claim, lease and post-push checks. Keep individual merges as the existing default path and record refused or incomplete batches for reconciliation.\n- Provide a runtime deployment patch, activation instructions and protocol notes. Runtime activation and the first live batch remain downstream of publication and independent review.\n\n### Testing\n- Published head `00e2079fb16f665721bf6b0fb209f07d22e0906f`: all nine local CI statuses passed in 410 seconds. All eight gates ran, including build, blueprint rendering, synchronization and statement-origin.\n- The CI workflow suite and normal commit hooks each passed 736 tests with 9 skipped. The author also passed 26 focused adapter/claim/synchronization tests, including seven adapter cases.\n- The rooted axiom audit passed 1,659 declarations with zero failures and three existing statement-level warnings. No proof-level leanok declaration depends on sorryAx.\n- The runtime patch passed a zero-fuzz dry-run and its offline preview passed shell syntax validation. All six source-file hashes and three active-runtime hashes were verified; no daemon installation, restart or live train has run.\n\n---\nAddresses #593\n", "created_at": "2026-09-18T06:10:44Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-18T06:23:43Z", "closed_at": null, "merged_at": null, "merge_commit_sha": "8c71f2b29da7fe0ac8b3fde5c9233cd5b6f999df", "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "labels": [{"id": 12025011061, "node_id": "LA_kwDOUJyJf88AAAACzL8bdQ", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/labels/infrastructure", "name": "infrastructure", "color": "ededed", "default": false, "description": "Foundational definitions, shared APIs, or supporting layers", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}], "milestone": null, "draft": false, "commits_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pulls/595/commits", "review_comments_url": "https://api.githu